                <h2>Reliable Smoke Extraction for Fire Safety Systems</h2>
                <p>Smoke exhaust units are a crucial part of building fire-safety and ventilation systems. They are designed to remove smoke and hot gases from enclosed areas during a fire emergency. By supporting control smoke movement, these systems can support safer evacuation and improve visibility in the building.</p>
                <p>For industrial, commercial, and high-rise projects that require reliable emergency ventilation, <b>Smoke Exhaust Unit Manufacturers in Delhi</b> provide systems designed according to airflow, static pressure, temperature, and location conditions. These units may be used in basements, department stores, factories, high-rise buildings, and other buildings where smoke extraction is a critical part of the fire-protection system.</p>
